  (text "1. ВХОД (5-22 V соларен панел, SS54 срещу обърнат поляритет) -> MPPT ЗАРЯДНО BQ25798 (1S, 750 kHz, 2.2 uH)" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d83d01d4-5c50-4328-81b4-18b71f68a7b0))
  (text "SS54 = OR на двата входа + защита от обратна полярност. D3 (SMBJ24A) пази VBUS до 25 V." (at 20 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid acada78a-5e6b-41b3-9f6d-80ed8d8cc882))
  (text "~CE: R4 към 3V3M = без заряд, докато MSPM0 не го свали (PA17). BQ25798 е на собствена I2C шина (SCL_I/SDA_I) към MSPM0. TP2 (QON) към GND = wake." (at 20 177.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2ce0c075-6767-40f8-a968-2d8670e0e73a))
  (text "2. СИСТЕМНО ЗАХРАНВАНЕ (SYS -> идеален диод Q5 AO3401A + Q6/Q7 -> XIAO 5V) + XIAO nRF52840 & Wio-SX1262 + I2C" (at 225 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2dbee1f3-1e9e-4eb4-b3f0-b7bbae2b40a9))
  (text "3. БАТЕРИЯ 1S (Li-ion / LiFePO4): Ship FET (Q2 + JP3) -> J4 -> BMS (DW01A + HJ8205) -> шунт RS1 20 mOhm -> GND" (at 20 188 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 32664446-eaa4-424e-b083-2775729950df))
